  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What you would do if…",
     "texto": [
      "To talk about something imaginary or impossible now, use **hvis** (if) + past tense in one part, and **ville** + infinitive in the other (would want, would do).",
      "Example: **Hvis jeg havde tid, ville jeg komme.** = If I had time, I'd come.",
      "With **være** the past tense is **var**: **Hvis jeg var rig, ville jeg rejse.** = If I were rich, I'd travel."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Past tense in the sentence with hvis",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Infinitive",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Past",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Example",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
